K-024 / R-005 review follow-up (commit 3) — remaining annual surfaces

Findings from the blind review at scratchpad/review-k024.md: 2 HIGH, 1 MEDIUM, 1 LOW.
All four addressed in one commit; nothing amended.

HIGH 1  pages/api/payroll/irp5/summary.ts had NO status predicate, so after commit 1 the
        review screen showed gross 1 210 000 while the file it previews wrote 3601,10000.
HIGH 2  pages/api/payroll/year-end/status.ts carried IN ('approved','posted','calculated')
        on all three of its payroll_run_headers queries — a second EMP501 balance check
        disagreeing with the reconciliation, and the source of certificatesReady.
MEDIUM  Both fix.md files claimed a completeness that did not hold. Rewritten: K-024/fix.md
        now enumerates every declaration surface by call site with its state, names the two
        bureau queries deliberately left alone, and its historical-impact query was widened
        from NOT IN ('approved','paid') to IN ('draft','calculated','cancelled','paid') so
        it covers the dropped-paid direction too.
LOW     easyfile-export.ts, reconciliation.ts and year-end/status.ts lacked the
        Number.isInteger taxYear guard their siblings have; ?taxYear=abc was a 500 (22P02).
        year-end/status.ts was not in the review's list but has the same gap and was already
        being edited, so it is fixed here as well.

