     the 3601 field the e@syFile export writes for the same employee.
  2. year-end checklist reports monthsCovered 2 / totalPaye 3 000 and its EMP501 totals
     equal the reconciliation route's, tested against each other.
  3. ?taxYear=abc and ?taxYear=9999 are 400 on all three previously-unguarded routes.

